  "description": "ZAWFIO crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C88 H100 N10 O24 Yb4 2+,2(N1 O3 1-),3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb1A (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb2A (Yb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.431-3.787 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.04-110.37°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Yb4(L)2(HL)2(NO3)2(OH)2]·2(NO3)·3H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
